{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08344","headline":"赠宣州灵源寺仲濬公 · 李白","name":"赠宣州灵源寺仲濬公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"敬亭白云气，秀色连苍梧。\n下映双溪水，如天落镜湖。\n此中积龙象，独许濬公殊。\n风韵逸江左，文章动海隅。\n观心同水月，解领得明珠。\n今日逢支遁，高谈出有无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}